        "ggU_N-qYNiq_text": "<p><strong>- James K., 61, Phoenix AZ&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "ggRbExvtONZ_text": "<p>\"I initiated on a Tuesday. We never do anything on Tuesdays. She was suspicious.\"</p>",
