        "ggJbZr565_u_text": "<p>Shilajit is generally well-tolerated. Some men experience mild digestive adjustment in the first few days as their body adapts. This typically passes quickly.</p>",
        "ggmO4sNTttZ_text": "<p>We recommend consulting your healthcare provider if you're on blood thinners, blood pressure medication, or diabetes medication. Shilajit may enhance the effects of some medications.</p>",
        "ggNqxOHlz2F_text": "<p>We offer a 90-day \"Feel The Difference\" guarantee. Full refund, no questions asked, even if the jar is empty.</p>",
